Text: 5.3 Results Table 2 presents the classiﬁcation results showing the performance of each feature set independently. Generally, we can see that the thematic information improves the performance of the proposed features clearly (RQ1), and with the largest amount in the Emotions features (see −themes and +themes columns). This result emphasizes the importance of the thematic information.

